# LF in the working tree on every platform. SYSTEM_PROMPT.md and the
# agent-skills SKILL.md files are include_str!'d at build time, and a CRLF
# checkout ships a binary whose own `\n`-boundary parsing of them fails.
#
# An existing clone keeps its CRLF working tree until each file next changes;
# `git add --renormalize .` converts it in one step.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The demo's commit ids are asserted against hardcoded SHAs, so these must never
# be treated as text and normalized.
*.pt binary
*.pkl binary

# VLResearch: README.md is this distribution's own; upstream's README edits are
# never merged into it. Needs `git config merge.ours.driver true` (the sync
# script sets it).
README.md merge=ours
